<title>UK: Clyde reports full-year profit rise.</title>
<headline>Clyde reports full-year profit rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.8		    vs 6.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.05		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 1.50		   vs 1.15</p>
<p> Pretax		     57.0		   vs 37.1</p>
<p> Earnings		   32.0		   vs 26.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   171.4		  vs 140.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Clyde Petroleum Plc.</p>
</text>
